# Mitochodria Emulated Storage Selection
#
# Selects the Android 9 ESDFS path before emulated storage is mounted.
#
# Authors:
# worryzu <worryzu@gmail.com> @LinearTeam
#
# Copyright (C) 2026 Evarentha
# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

# Android 9 sdcard selects esdfs when force_off and esdfs is available.
# Apply before vold mounts emulated storage; do not alter userdata contents.
on post-fs-data
    setprop persist.sys.sdcardfs force_off
